{
  "id": "demoA",
  "title": "What If You Could See How Much Everyone Trusts You?",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "speed": 1.0,
  "theme": "modern",
  "scenes": [
    {"text": "You wake up one morning, and something feels different.", "bg": "bedroom",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "stretch", "pose2": "idle", "x": 900, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "sleepy", "mood2": "normal"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.25, 1.05], "x": [0, 0], "y": [40, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "title", "text": "WHAT IF YOU COULD SEE WHO TRUSTS YOU?"}, "sfx": "whoosh"},
    {"text": "Everyone around you has a soft glow, and the color tells you exactly how much they trust you.", "bg": "street",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "walk", "x": 560, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "wide"},
               {"id": "a", "pose": "idle", "x": 1150, "color": "#e76f51", "glow": "#7bd389"},
               {"id": "b", "pose": "idle", "x": 1450, "color": "#6d597a", "glow": "#f4d35e", "facing": -1}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.12], "x": [0, -80], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "tag", "text": "GLOW = TRUST", "at": 0.45}, "sfx": "shimmer"},
    {"text": "Green means they would trust you with anything.", "bg": "abstract",
     "chars": [{"id": "a", "pose": "happy", "x": 960, "color": "#e76f51", "glow": "#7bd389", "mood": "happy"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.1, 1.2], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "tag", "text": "GREEN", "color": "#7bd389", "at": 0.2}, "sfx": "pop"},
    {"text": "Yellow means they are not quite sure about you yet.", "bg": "abstract",
     "chars": [{"id": "b", "pose": "think", "x": 960, "color": "#6d597a", "glow": "#f4d35e"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.2, 1.1], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "tag", "text": "YELLOW", "color": "#f4d35e", "at": 0.2}, "sfx": "pop"},
    {"text": "And red means they do not trust you at all.", "bg": "abstract",
     "chars": [{"id": "c", "pose": "skeptical", "x": 960, "color": "#264653", "glow": "#ef476f", "mood": "narrow"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.05, 1.3], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, -30]},
     "overlay": {"type": "tag", "text": "RED", "color": "#ef476f", "at": 0.25}, "sfx": "boom"},
    {"text": "At school, your best friend walks in glowing bright green.", "bg": "hallway",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "wave", "x": 700, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "happy"},
               {"id": "a", "pose": "walk", "pose2": "wave", "x": 1250, "color": "#e76f51", "glow": "#7bd389", "facing": -1, "enter": "right", "mood": "happy"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.08], "x": [0, 40], "y": [0, 0]}, "sfx": "ding"},
    {"text": "Then your teacher looks up from her desk, and her glow is yellow.", "bg": "classroom",
     "chars": [{"id": "t", "pose": "skeptical", "x": 1300, "color": "#8d6e63", "glow": "#f4d35e", "facing": -1, "hair": "bun"},
               {"id": "hero", "pose": "idle", "pose2": "surprised", "x": 620, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "wide"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.15], "x": [0, -120], "y": [0, 0]}, "sfx": "pop"},
    {"text": "Fair enough. You did forget your homework three times this month.", "bg": "classroom",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "shrug", "x": 960, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "awkward"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.2, 1.25], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "sticker", "text": "3X", "at": 0.6}, "sfx": "pop"},
    {"text": "But then you see it.", "bg": "hallway", "transition": "sticky",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "surprised", "x": 960, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "wide"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.45], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, -40]}, "sfx": "whoosh"},
    {"text": "Sam, the friend who knows every single one of your secrets, is glowing red.", "bg": "hallway",
     "chars": [{"id": "sam", "pose": "idle", "pose2": "skeptical", "x": 1180, "color": "#f4a261", "glow": "#ef476f", "facing": -1, "mood": "narrow"},
               {"id": "hero", "pose": "surprised", "x": 620, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "wide"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.05, 1.2], "x": [0, -140], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "tag", "text": "SAM = RED?!", "color": "#ef476f", "at": 0.55}, "sfx": "boom"},
    {"text": "In studies, people spot a lie only about fifty-four percent of the time, barely better than a coin flip.", "bg": "abstract",
     "chars": [],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.05], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "bars", "bars": [{"label": "HUMANS", "value": 54, "color": "#f4d35e"}, {"label": "COIN FLIP", "value": 50, "color": "#adb5bd"}], "at": 0.15}, "sfx": "ding"},
    {"text": "With this power, you would be right every single time.", "bg": "abstract",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "point", "x": 760, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "normal"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.1, 1.0], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, 0]},
     "overlay": {"type": "sticker", "text": "100%", "at": 0.5}, "sfx": "pop"},
    {"text": "So here is the real question. Would you actually want to know?", "bg": "bedroom",
     "chars": [{"id": "hero", "pose": "think", "x": 960, "color": "#2a9d8f", "mood": "normal"}],
     "cam": {"z": [1.0, 1.3], "x": [0, 0], "y": [0, -30]},
     "overlay": {"type": "endcard", "text": "WOULD YOU WANT TO KNOW?", "at": 0.55}, "sfx": "shimmer"}
  ]
}
